I agree to what players say about this game: It takes the best from both Hearthstone and Magic Duels, and cuts unnecessary stuff to keep this game
If you already played an online TCG then the cards' abilities are very similar to those you are already used to play, you can play "fast spells" to surprise your opponent, or use standard spells/card attachments/summon during your turn. Some card attachments (relic weapons) can be used on your avatar, giving him the ability to attack too (until they wear out): in my opinion this is much better than using "hero's skill"(hearthstone) or "planeswalker abilities"(magic) because it is simpler to use/understand, and since they are usable by anyone the game is never unbalanced.
You always get some kind of reward by playing, in single player or multiplayer, unlocking new card is never frustrating and it is very easy to earn ingame coins since you can earn a lot of them just doing "daily missions" or playing any game mode. There are many fun and different game modes to play and there are ranks for any of them:
