Willy-Nilly Knight is a game for those who want to relax after a hard day at work/school. Nice game with a charming atmosphere.
Advantages:
1) Nice graphics, unique atmosphere that let you immerse yourself into a game;
2) Memorable soundtrack;
3)  Fascinating and interesting plot;
4) The game is quite simple even for beginners. I guess, 2 minutes will be enough to understand how the game works;
5) Lots of ""easter eggs"" and references and I like it a lot!
Some minor disadvantages:
1) Camera's trembling a little bit;
2) Found some mistakes in translation.
But these problems should not make you pass by this fascinating interactive fairy tale about King Arthur. In addition, the developers promised to fix them in the next update, which will be released the other day
Summary: 10 Arthurs out of 10!

